Subject: [PATCH] Default summary language: same as the article

Summaries used to default to Bulgarian. New installs now answer in the
language of the source text; English and Bulgarian remain selectable.
---
 README.md             | 2 +-
 src/options.html      | 2 +-
 src/options.js        | 2 +-
 src/shared.js         | 4 ++--
 tests/shared.test.mjs | 7 +++++++
 5 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

